{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 14 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">2D→3D 与神经场：表示能力、投影一致性和不可辨识性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D-to-3D &amp; Neural Fields</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_072_nerf-title\">NeRF</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">位置编码坐标 MLP 预测连续密度与视角相关颜色，再沿相机射线做可微体渲染。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Represents a continuous 3D scene as a 5D coordinate MLP (x,y,z,θ,φ) → (σ, c) with Fourier positional encoding, optimized via differentiable emission–absorption volume rendering.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">带相机内外参的多视角 RGB 图像与采样射线</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D spatial coordinates x=(x,y,z) and 2D viewing direction d=(θ,φ) along calibrated camera rays</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">新视角渲染图像及连续密度/颜色场</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Volume density σ(x), view-dependent RGB radiance c(x,d), and rendered 2D novel views</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 7 · PDF p.18</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.08934\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_072_nerf')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_072_nerf')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"NeRF original paper architecture figure, Figure 7\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/d84ce484840cb317fdb2.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 7 · PDF p.18</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_072_nerf\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_072_nerf')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_072_nerf\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">多视角图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">每个像素对应已知相机原点 o 与方向 d</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d spatial coordinates x=(x,y,z) and 2d viewing direction d=(θ,φ) along calibrated camera rays and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"每个像素对应已知相机原点 o 与方向 d\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d spatial coordinates x=(x,y,z) and 2d viewing direction d=(θ,φ) along calibrated camera rays and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"多视角图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多视角图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个像素对应已知相机原点 o 与方向 d</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d spatial coordinates x=(x,y,z) and 2d viewing direction d=(θ,φ) along calibrated camera rays and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"沿 r(t)=o+t d 分层采样 3D 点\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Ray Sampling to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"射线采样\" data-node-name-en=\"Ray Sampling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">射线采样</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Ray Sampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">沿 r(t)=o+t d 分层采样 3D 点</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Ray Sampling to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将坐标 x 与方向 d 映射到多频 Fourier features\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Positional Encoding within the core neural radiance field computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"位置编码\" data-node-name-en=\"Positional Encoding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">位置编码</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Positional Encoding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将坐标 x 与方向 d 映射到多频 Fourier features</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Positional Encoding within the core neural radiance field computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"F_theta(x) 输出体密度 sigma 与中间特征；sigma 与视角无关\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs MLP within the core neural radiance field computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"密度 MLP\" data-node-name-en=\"MLP\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">密度 MLP</span><span class=\"lang-en\">MLP</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">F_theta(x) 输出体密度 sigma 与中间特征；sigma 与视角无关</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs MLP within the core neural radiance field computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"结合方向 d 输出视角相关 RGB c(x,d)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 05 within the core neural radiance field computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"颜色头\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 05\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">颜色头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 05</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">结合方向 d 输出视角相关 RGB c(x,d)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 05 within the core neural radiance field computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按 transmittance 与 alpha compositing 累积沿射线颜色\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Volume Rendering Integral within the core neural radiance field computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"体渲染积分\" data-node-name-en=\"Volume Rendering Integral\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">体渲染积分</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Volume Rendering Integral</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按 transmittance 与 alpha compositing 累积沿射线颜色</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Volume Rendering Integral within the core neural radiance field computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"比较渲染像素与观测 RGB，监督 per-scene field\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs loss within the core neural radiance field computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"光度损失\" data-node-name-en=\"loss\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">光度损失</span><span class=\"lang-en\">loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">比较渲染像素与观测 RGB，监督 per-scene field</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs loss within the core neural radiance field computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"反复采样射线并更新 MLP；经典 NeRF 每场景训练\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies optimization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"场景优化\" data-node-name-en=\"optimization\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">场景优化</span><span class=\"lang-en\">optimization</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">反复采样射线并更新 MLP；经典 NeRF 每场景训练</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies optimization to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从任意相机射线查询连续场并渲染\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces volume density σ(x), view-dependent rgb radiance c(x,d), and rendered 2d novel views via Stage 09.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"新视角\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 09\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_072_nerf', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">新视角</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 09</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从任意相机射线查询连续场并渲染</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces volume density σ(x), view-dependent rgb radiance c(x,d), and rendered 2d novel views via Stage 09.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"NeRF Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · NeRF 发射—吸收体渲染积分</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Classical Emission–Absorption Volume Rendering Integral Along Camera Rays</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"NeRF：核心公式 · NeRF 发射—吸收体渲染积分\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"72\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"24.639999pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYM