2_g7-186\" y=\"-54.33342\"></use><use x=\"199.814799\" xlink:href=\"#m072_g7-186\" y=\"-54.33342\"></use><use x=\"205.539936\" xlink:href=\"#m072_g16-51\" y=\"-54.33342\"></use><use x=\"210.750395\" xlink:href=\"#m072_g16-66\" y=\"-54.33342\"></use><use x=\"215.074177\" xlink:href=\"#m072_g4-19\" y=\"-68.393184\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">离散 voxel/mesh 分辨率固定，novel-view fidelity 受限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Discrete voxel grids scaled cubically in memory, while triangle meshes struggled to optimize complex topology via gradient descent.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">连续坐标 MLP 表示密度和视角相关颜色，并沿射线可微体渲染</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Encode continuous spatial coordinates with high-frequency sinusoids so a compact MLP memorizes a continuous volumetric density and radiance field.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">positional encoding、per-scene optimization 与连续 volumetric rendering</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Fourier positional encoding overcoming MLP spectral bias + hierarchical coarse-to-fine stratified ray sampling.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">启发稀疏投影 attenuation fields、内镜场建模和医学 INR</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Catalyzed medical Implicit Neural Representations (INRs), sparse-view CBCT attenuation fields (NAF), and surgical endoscopy scene reconstruction.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">场表示基础；原始可见光 alpha-compositing 不能直接当 X-ray 物理</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational neural field paradigm; visible-light occlusion/emission rendering must be rewritten into Beer–Lambert transmission for X-ray/CT.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">用连续坐标 MLP 表示场景，而非固定分辨率 voxel/mesh；任意位置都可查询。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">位置编码提供高频基函数，使 MLP 能拟合细节；方向条件只进入颜色分支。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">可微 alpha-compositing 将像素误差反传到整条射线的密度与颜色。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Encode continuous spatial coordinates with high-frequency sinusoids so a compact MLP memorizes a continuous volumetric density and radiance field.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Fourier positional encoding overcoming MLP spectral bias + hierarchical coarse-to-fine stratified ray sampling.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Classical Emission–Absorption Volume Rendering Integral Along Camera Rays.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可启发内镜新视角、医学隐式场和稀疏投影场表示。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">原始 NeRF 的可见光发射—吸收 RGB 模型不是 X-ray 线积分物理，不能直接解释为衰减系数或 HU。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Catalyzed medical Implicit Neural Representations (INRs), sparse-view CBCT attenuation fields (NAF), and surgical endoscopy scene reconstruction.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Foundational neural field paradigm; visible-light occlusion/emission rendering must be rewritten into Beer–Lambert transmission for X-ray/CT.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.08934\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>NeRF: Representing Scenes as Neural Radiance Fields for View Synthesis</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/bmild/nerf\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
